## Icon sources

Brand icons live in `src/assets/logos/`, `src/assets/providers/` and in
`src/components/ToolIcon.tsx`. Each SVG under those two asset directories also
carries its source in a header comment, except where noted as "no header".

Full license texts for the MIT-licensed icon sources are kept in
`third_party/licenses/`:

- `lobe-icons-MIT.txt` — lobehub/lobe-icons, MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub
- `opencode-MIT.txt` — anomalyco/opencode, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 opencode

Icons from lobehub/lobe-icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons, MIT,
Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub), package @lobehub/icons-static-svg:

- `src/assets/logos/doubao.svg` (icons/doubao-color.svg, v1.95.1). This is a
  third-party redraw, not an asset published by the trademark owner.
- `src/assets/providers/*.svg` — all 15 files; each header comment names its
  lobe-icons file (bailian, groq, hunyuan, longcat, mistral, modelscope,
  opencode, openrouter, qianfan, siliconflow, stepfun, volcengine, xai,
  xiaomi-mimo, zai)
- Codex mark inline in `ToolIcon.tsx` (`CodexMark`, path identical to lobe-icons
  icons/codex.svg)

Existing model-brand SVGs in `src/assets/logos/` (no header): `claude.svg`,
`gemini.svg`, `deepseek.svg`, `kimi.svg`, `minimax.svg`, `zhipu.svg`,
`chatglm.svg`, `openai.svg`, `codex.svg`. Their markup has the lobe-icons static
SVG shape (`<title>`, `height="1em"`, `flex:none`); `claude.svg`, `deepseek.svg`
and `zhipu.svg` are byte-identical (ignoring line breaks) to lobe-icons v1.95.1
`claude-color.svg`, `deepseek-color.svg` and `zhipu-color.svg`; the others differ
from v1.95.1 (older release or locally recolored). Provenance is therefore
inferred as lobe-icons (MIT), exact source and version 来源待核.

Obsidian: no Obsidian logo is shipped. The owner's brand page
(https://obsidian.md/brand) says the logo must not be edited, recolored or
reconfigured, and that commercial use of Obsidian assets requires contacting
the owner first. U-King is a commercial product and has no such permission, so
Obsidian entries use the initial-letter fallback tile. If permission is
obtained, use the original from the owner's site
(https://obsidian.md/images/obsidian-logo-gradient.svg), unmodified, and update
this file.

Icons from official product sites or repositories:

- `src/assets/logos/pi.svg` — official favicon of pi (https://pi.dev/favicon.svg).
  The mark path comes from the official file; the dark rounded tile behind it
  was redrawn by U-King so the mark stays visible on light and dark themes.
  The same graphic is listed in simple-icons (CC0). The project's code
  repository (github.com/earendil-works/pi; the older badlogic/pi-mono address
  redirects to it) is MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner per its LICENSE file
  (checked 2026-09-30); the pi.dev site footer credits "Earendil Inc. &
  Contributors". No separate license statement for the favicon graphic was
  found. Trademark remains with its owner.
- `src/assets/logos/opencode.svg` — packages/identity/mark.svg of
  github.com/anomalyco/opencode at commit
  1251a870cb384543c150c4a72fb101b55eec971b (the upstream file wraps the real
  svg, which already has its own viewBox, in an outer svg plus an unused
  `<style>`; U-King kept only the inner svg, with its geometry and colors
  unchanged).
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 opencode. Trademark remains with its owner.
- `src/assets/logos/qwenwork.svg` — mark cropped from the page-header logo of
